fixture ground_drop_through
doc BUILD.md s5 Ground: "Crouch ... drops through one-way platforms on down+jump"
room test/oneway
spawn 400 384
frames 40
input
  0..4 D
  5 D jump
  6..20 D
end
expect
  at 0 ground=1 y=384u crouch=1
  at 5 state=air event.drop_through=1 vy>=0 y>384u
  never 5..39 event.jump=1
  mark floor 6..39 event.land=1
  at floor y=544u
end
